    {
      "text": "Forest plot of sensitivity and specificity with 95% confidence intervals for 4 studies in children: nasopharyngeal aspirate with a composite reference standard. Sensitivity ranges from 0.09 to 0.36, while specificity is 1.00 in all studies.",
